{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265260/extras/OGORA_DESCRIPTION_1.png?t=1740740575\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ogora: Prologue is the free version of the roguelike deckbuilding game<strong> Ogora.</strong> Get a taste of the ever winding world of Ogora: Prologue as Jax, the trusty battle axe who will hack and slash (with a few wary friends by his side).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this prologue you will be able to find a limited selection of partners, cards, trinkets and monsters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265260/extras/banner_1.png?t=1740740575\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265260/extras/OGORA_STEAM_GIF_5.gif?t=1740740575\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover the magical garden of Ogora and test your mind (and your luck) against your enchanted friends - while the Wizard tries to get a moment of peace!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uncover secrets within the hedges of the garden (or make a path of your own!). But be careful, not everyone in the garden will aid you!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265260/extras/banner_3.png?t=1740740575\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265260/extras/OGORA_STEAM_GIF_4.gif?t=1740740575\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Draft new powers, ancient spells, or hoard your explosives for those pesky pillows and ornery ottomans that block your path.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experiment with a massive number of unique cards, heavily guarded spells, and hidden trinkets \u2013 seriously, some of these are pretty secret.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each run will present new challenges, difficult choices, and a unique friend to help you!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265260/extras/banner_2.png?t=1740740575\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265260/extras/OGORA_STEAM_GIF_2.gif?t=1740740575\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Select your hero and choose a Partner to aid you in your journey. Each partner offers unique powers and abilities, so choose carefully!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whoever you don\u2019t choose is out to win, so make sure you\u2019re prepared!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Forge your own path as you journey through - Ogora!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3265260?t=1740740575","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265260/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1740740575","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265260/5cd0be40ea4a6c94937dbeec83ea843da7c71b6f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740740575","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265260/5cd0be40ea4a6c94937dbeec83ea843da7c71b6f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740740575","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265260/extras/OGORA_DESCRIPTION_1.png?t=1740740575\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph